{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年58歲的無綫午間節目《流行都市》元老級主持劉彩玉，陪伴無數家庭觀眾度過悠閒午後時光。</p><p>然而，近日有眼利網民發現她已久未現身電視螢幕。</p><p>翻查TVB官方網站，其藝員資料更已被悄然下架，已在今年約滿低調離巢，為長達32年的賓主關係畫下句號。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T06:07:14.604373+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T05:14:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:00:17.805120+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:00:17.805120+00:00","content_hash":"75862ea9e45aa835132530534921ba3275ebac3c49fb2a521590e0931a1868ec","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}